          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 341,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.100:block:1",
          "start": 149
        },
        "quote": "(b) It shall be unlawful for any private security firm to allow any person to perform work as an employee, agent, or guard unless the person has obtained a license as provided in this article.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.100:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.100 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "d9a40f5d-e172-56ca-b7f3-10c7af76a245",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 512,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.100:block:2",
          "start": 342
        },
        "quote": "(c) It shall be unlawful for any person to perform work as an employee, agent or guard of a private security firm without obtaining a license as provided in this article.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.100:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.100 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "aefa08e4-212c-5cee-a49f-75216be442b1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 810,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.100:block:3",
          "start": 513
        },
        "quote": "(d) This article is intended to be in addition to all other permits or licenses vested in persons by the State, County or City, and it shall not be a defense to the failure to secure a license to protect or preserve the peace of one or more establishments that the person had such other authority.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.100:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.100 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "d0a6dea3-267c-59b9-8ac4-e5cc1d98673c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 968,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.100:block:4",
          "start": 811
        },
        "quote": "(e) The following persons shall not be deemed to be private security guards and shall not be required to obtain a license to act as a private security guard:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.100:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.100 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "5cef5a0a-e306-5007-afa9-4afd97c5b49d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1231,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.100:block:5",
          "start": 969
        },
        "quote": "(1) Persons employed exclusively and regularly by one employer in connection only with the affairs of such employer, where there exists an employer-employee relationship, and where the operation is conducted solely and completely on the property of the employer.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.100:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.100 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "2baccec0-410d-519c-ab70-f352f3b49ef0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1417,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.100:block:6",
          "start": 1232
        },
        "quote": "(2) Any officer or employee of the United States, of this State, or of a political subdivision thereof, while engaged in the performance of the office or the employee’s official duties.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.100:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.100 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "3fc0262e-6a46-5bcc-9fc5-d989daaf606b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1524,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.100:block:7",
          "start": 1418
        },
        "quote": "(3) State-certified law enforcement officers as defined in K.S.A. 74-5602 et seq., and amendments thereto.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.100:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.100 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "5684d9f6-782b-5645-bc80-8b45d55ec7c9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1875,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.100:block:8",
          "start": 1525
        },
        "quote": "(4) Any person who holds a valid commission as an officer of the Topeka, Kansas, police reserves or any person who holds a valid commission as an officer of the Shawnee County sheriff’s office reserve and who has successfully completed training as a reserve officer, except such persons shall not be exempt from the fee requirements of TMC 5.10.160 .",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.100:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
